OL,3,GNEWSAMen charged after woman dies in   
OL,4,Acollision                              
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged after a woman
OL,7,Fdied in a collision with a car.        
OL,9,FSuffolk Police was called to Wherstead 
OL,10,FRoad in Ipswich to reports of a        
OL,11,Fcollision involving a grey Nissan and a
OL,12,Fpedestrian just before 14:50 GMT on    
OL,13,FWednesday.                             
OL,15,FThe pedestrian, a 58-year-old woman,   
OL,16,Fwas declared dead at the scene before  
OL,17,FAvram Bahica, 19, of Bruff Road,       
OL,18,FIpswich and Samuel Hurmuz, 20, of      
OL,19,FWherstead Road, were arrested.         
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
