OL,3,GNEWSAMen charged after woman dies in   
OL,4,Acollision                              
OL,6,FThey appeared at Ipswich Magistrates'  
OL,7,FCourt earlier, charged with causing    
OL,8,Fdeath by dangerous driving. They were  
OL,9,Fremanded in custody and will next      
OL,10,Fappear at Ipswich Crown Court on 4     
OL,11,FJanuary.                               
